# Frontend structure

- **`frontend/src/pages/`** — route-level screens; keep them thin; delegate to components.
- **`frontend/src/components/`** — reusable UI; group by feature (`Members/`, `Trainings/`, …) when it helps navigation.
- **`frontend/src/services/`** — API calls via **`apiClient`** only; see `apiConfig.ts`.
- **`frontend/src/types/`** — TypeScript models aligned with backend DTOs.

For **maintenance workflow**, HTTP/React Query/MUI rules, and quality bar, see **frontend-maintenance**.
